  {
    "hotel_id": "479243",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/the-pod-beach-road-boutique-capsule-hotel/hotel/singapore-sg.html",
    "name": "The Pod @ Beach Road Boutique Capsule Hotel",
    "detail": "My second stay at the pod and the experience has been consistently good. Staff are friendly and ready to help at all times. They try their best even when they are busy due to high occupancy when I stayed last weekend. Breakfast selection changes daily and its so rare to have sushi and hot buffet breakfast for a budget hotel like this! I stayed at other 3* budget hotels in Singapore and they don't even provide breakfast. Nespresso coffee is also a nice touch. Bathrooms are so clean and dry, and I didn't have to wait for my turn. Will definitely stay here during my next trip to Singapore.",
