  {
    "hotel_id": "611406",
    "hotel_url": "https://www.agoda.com/hotel-clover-the-arts/hotel/singapore-sg.html",
    "name": "Hotel Clover The Arts",
    "detail": "Hotels in Singapore is quite expensive but I think the deal I got from this hotel is good. Its not a big hotel and the room is not that big too so the space is maximized but its not a problem for me since I’m a solo traveler and I was out most of the time. Moreover, I like the artsy paintings in the wall. Take note though that they are going to charge a deposit of 50sgd when you check-in as for the reason they stated incase there is something broken. Dont forget to take it back at the end of your stay or remind them to return it in your bank account if you use a card. This hotel is very near Clarke Quay Central Mall, Clarke Quay MRT station N5, 7/11 and different restaurants. Sometimes I used grab to move around the city. The google map is very much helpful too. I got a 12sgd simcard w/ 100gb data from airport. With regards to breakfast, on my first day they sent me to hotel clover 5 hongkong st which is only a few blocks away. The breakfast is fine but not much to choose from. ",
